      "skill_tags": ["factorising", "quadratic_expressions", "nested_quadratics"],
      "problem_text": "Factorise fully: $(x^2 + 3x)^2 - 14(x^2 + 3x) + 40$",
      "answer": "$(x + 5)(x - 2)(x - 1)(x + 4)$",
      "solution": "Let $u = x^2 + 3x$. Then expression = $u^2 - 14u + 40 = (u-4)(u-10)$. Sub back: $(x^2+3x-4)(x^2+3x-10)$. Factor each: $(x+4)(x-1)(x+5)(x-2)$"
    },
    {
